# Feature Modules

**Strict file order:** `types.ts` → `*Api.ts` → `*Thunks.ts` → `*Slice.ts` → `*Selectors.ts`

**Dependency:** types ← Api ← Thunks ← Slice ← Selectors. Never import upward.

```ts
// Thunks: always rejectWithValue(extractApiErrorMessage(err, "…"))
// Slice: handle pending/fulfilled/rejected; toast on successful mutations when UX needs it
// Register new reducer in src/store/index.ts (kit) / rootReducer.ts (production)
```

Canonical kit example: `src/features/demo/item/`.
